{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:13.20.475","page_type":"section"},"citation":"13.20.475","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.20.475","content_hash":"23c24b2fbc2376f6fbe68201c0171217b8e906aeee3928aba4c1e317be494690","heading":"Wastewater discharge permit – Revocation.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.475:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.20.475","text":"(a) The Utilities Director may revoke a wastewater discharge permit for good cause, including, but not limited to, the following reasons:\n(1) Failure to notify the Utilities Director of significant changes to the wastewater prior to the changed discharge;\n(2) Failure to provide prior notification to the Utilities Director of changed conditions pursuant to TMC 13.20.520(f) ;\n(3) Misrepresentation or failure to fully disclose all relevant facts in the wastewater discharge permit application;\n(4) Falsifying self-monitoring reports and certification statements;\n(5) Tampering with monitoring equipment;\n(6) Refusing to allow the Utilities Director timely access to the facility premises and records;\n(7) Failure to meet effluent limitations;\n(8) Failure to pay administrative monetary penalties;\n(9) Failure to pay sewer charges;\n(10) Failure to meet compliance schedules;\n(11) Failure to complete a wastewater survey or the wastewater discharge permit application;\n(12) Failure to provide advance notice of the transfer of business ownership of a permitted facility; or\n(13) Violation of any pretreatment standard or requirement, or any terms of the wastewater discharge permit or Chapter 13.20 , 13.25 , 13.30 or 13.35 TMC.\n(b) Wastewater discharge permits shall be voidable upon cessation of operations or transfer of business ownership. All wastewater discharge permits issued to a user are void upon the issuance of a new wastewater discharge permit to that user. (Ord. 20089 § 70, 10-17-17.)","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"f6bb211f-52b7-5f70-a37f-11caa7d13915"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"13.20.475","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.20.475","content_hash":"c449cdd66fd37381746ab58c4ae36d0ac101667368affe915040a560aa5dec12","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.475:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.475:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.20.475","text":"(a) The Utilities Director may revoke a wastewater discharge permit for good cause, including, but not limited to, the following reasons:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"73a4f15c-e237-5cc8-84fd-71793bd6776f"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"13.20.475","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.20.475","content_hash":"a580905d36c2898df4198b3aea9562757cf77e04240f1266526cd4fc7089fb42","heading":null,"ordinal":1,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.475:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.475:block:1","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.20.475","text":"(1) Failure to notify the Utilities Director of significant changes to the wastewater prior to the changed discharge;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"c4f4c2bd-3c45-59e2-813f-2ceb4f73bdff"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"13.20.475","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.20.475","content_hash":"8db1a47bb00b229fe17176a5ccb245834848fe04de00fa2a110fa721ef161278","heading":null,"ordinal":2,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.475:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.475:block:2","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.20.475","text":"(2) Failure to provide prior notification to the Utilities Director of changed conditions pursuant to TMC 13.20.520(f) ;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"6ac45c3e-8ff0-553a-9f48-0474c3457e68"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"13.20.475","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.20.475","content_hash":"646e5317119a7719dfedc4144747cd4b30dcde55f9741337574fecd48a2523c1","heading":null,"ordinal":3,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.475:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.475:block:3","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.20.475","text":"(3) Misrepresentation or failure to fully disclose all relevant facts in the wastewater discharge permit application;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"6089add6-cc94-5eca-a41a-040dbffe2ef0"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"13.20.475","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.20.475","content_hash":"d4062f7f99f1d7dfc98903ee9be6c62c1a7fe69770ff5b76e436e4ac58d7e338","heading":null,"ordinal":4,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.475:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.475:block:4","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.20.475","text":"(4) Falsifying self-monitoring reports and certification statements;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"25f9bd84-500d-56ae-970f-12062d84f71c"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"13.20.475","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.20.475","content_hash":"7dac6c78a2c3e9c107ae9ae187623f30e934fc66b4704d10d823d868ce23609b","heading":